px 20px; font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#666666; text-align:center; border-bottom-left-radius:16px; border-bottom-right-radius:16px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Sitio web: <a href=\"https://www.postialo.com\" style=\"color:#002073; text-decoration:none;\">www.postialo.com</a> | WhatsApp: <a href=\"https://wa.me/50379870006\" style=\"color:#002073; text-decoration:none;\">+503 7987 0006</a></p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;\">Si deseas cancelar la suscripción, haz <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#e3001b; text-decoration:none;\">clic aquí</a>.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
